A value whose plain YAML form is an integer is written unquoted, so a reader loads it as a
number and not as text.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md sp=23
-- exit --
0
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: sp=23
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
sp: 23
---
# Body
